---
import Layout from '../../layouts/SystemsLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Documentation & Quickstart | Sans Serif Systems">
  <div class="glow-blob glow-cyan"></div>
  <div class="glow-blob glow-purple"></div>

  <section class="page-header">
    <span class="meta-badge">QUICKSTART</span>
    <h1>Documentation & Guides</h1>
    <p>
      CLI commands, package configurations, and API integration paths for developers running the Sans Serif systems bench.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="docs-container">
    <!-- Left Navigation -->
    <div class="docs-nav card-glass">
      <h5>Quickstart</h5>
      <a href="#install" class="active">Installation</a>
      <a href="#config">Configuration</a>
      <a href="#cli">CLI Commands</a>
      <a href="#api">API Integration</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="docs-main card-glass">
      <section id="install" class="docs-section">
        <h2>Local Installation</h2>
        <p>The Systems bench is available as npm packages for Node.js and pip packages for Python environments. Install individual utilities globally or as local project devDependencies:</p>
        
        <div class="terminal-box">
          <span class="terminal-prompt">$</span>
          <code class="terminal-cmd">npm install -g @sans-serif/prompt-json</code>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-box" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          <span class="terminal-prompt">$</span>
          <code class="terminal-cmd">pip install sans-serif-workflow</code>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="config" class="docs-section" style="margin-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border); padding-top: 2rem;">
        <h2>Configuration Parameters</h2>
        <p>Define configuration keys globally or inside local `.env` files inside your codebase directories. By default, the utilities operate in <strong>local-first mode</strong>, executing transformations without making external web API network calls.</p>
        <pre class="code-block"><code># Local environment configuration
SANS_SERIF_ENV=development
SANS_SERIF_LOCAL_FIRST=true
SANS_SERIF_LLM_PROVIDER=gemini</code></pre>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 3rem;
  }

  .meta-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.08);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .page-header p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Docs Layout */
  .docs-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin: 3rem 0 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .docs-nav {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .docs-nav h5 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .docs-nav a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .docs-nav a:hover,
  .docs-nav a.active {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.05);
  }

  .docs-main {
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  .docs-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  .docs-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .terminal-box {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }

  .terminal-prompt {
    color: var(--accent-orange);
  }

  .terminal-cmd {
    color: #a7f3d0;
  }

  .code-block {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .code-block code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .docs-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
